odyssey.role.telemachus=§b[Role: Telemachus — Prince of Ithaca] §7Passive: Swiftness I & Co-op Synergy with Odysseus.
odyssey.role.companion=§a[Role: Ithacan Crew Companion] §7Passive: Shared Aura Support.
