odyssey.branch.ogygia.prompt=§6[Decision: Ogygia] §fHow will Odysseus answer Calypso's offer of immortality?
odyssey.branch.ogygia.a=§b[Option 1] §fReject immortality & set sail for Ithaca (Grants Strength I & Speed I)
odyssey.branch.ogygia.b=§d[Option 2] §fPartake of Ogygia's Lotus sanctuary (Grants +3 Lotus Flowers & Regeneration II)
odyssey.branch.ogygia.res_a=§aYou choose the mortal road home to Penelope and Telemachus. Athena's resolve strengthens your limbs!
odyssey.branch.ogygia.res_b=§dYou gather Calypso's Lotus blossoms; their restorative mist lingers over the crew.
odyssey.branch.troy.prompt=§6[Decision: Troy] §fAs Troy falls, how does your crew depart the shore?
odyssey.branch.troy.a=§b[Option 1] §fOffer sacrifice at Athena's Temple (Grants Absorption II & Resistance I)
odyssey.branch.troy.b=§c[Option 2] §fSeize the royal spoils of Troy (Grants Golden Apples & Iron Sword)
odyssey.branch.troy.res_a=§aAthena accepts your tribute at Troy and wards your hull against the trials ahead.
odyssey.branch.troy.res_b=§6Your crew loads the Trojan treasury into the ships, though the gods watch in silence.
odyssey.branch.cyclops.prompt=§6[Decision: Cyclops Island] §fPolyphemus is blinded! How do you depart his shore?
odyssey.branch.cyclops.a=§b[Option 1] §fSlip away silently beneath the rams (Grants Stealth Invisibility & Speed II)
odyssey.branch.cyclops.b=§c[Option 2] §fShout your true name: "Odysseus of Ithaca!" (Grants +5 XP Levels & Strength II, calls Poseidon's storm)
odyssey.branch.cyclops.res_a=§aHidden beneath the wool, your crew slips silently down to the ships.
odyssey.branch.cyclops.res_b=§cYour boast echoes across the bay! Polyphemus calls upon Poseidon as thunder splits the sky!
odyssey.branch.aeaea.prompt=§6[Decision: Aeaea] §fCirce has yielded. What pact do you strike with the witch of Aeaea?
odyssey.branch.aeaea.a=§b[Option 1] §fSwear peace & accept her counsel (Grants Circe's Stew & Regeneration I)
odyssey.branch.aeaea.b=§e[Option 2] §fDemandBeeswax supplies for the Sirens (Grants +4 Wax)
odyssey.branch.aeaea.res_a=§5Circe pledges her arcane aid and shares the secret route to Hades.
odyssey.branch.aeaea.res_b=§eCirce hands over sealed cakes of beeswax to guard your crew against the Sirens' song.
odyssey.branch.strait.prompt=§6[Decision: The Strait] §fWhich course do you steer between Scylla and Charybdis?
odyssey.branch.strait.a=§b[Option 1] §fHug Scylla's cliff as Tiresias advised (Grants Resistance II against the heads)
odyssey.branch.strait.b=§3[Option 2] §fRow hard along Charybdis's outer rim (Grants Speed II surge)
odyssey.branch.strait.res_a=§aYou brace shields along the cliffside as Scylla's six necks strike from the cavern!
odyssey.branch.strait.res_b=§3Your oarsmen strain with all their might around the roaring edge of Charybdis!
odyssey.branch.thrinacia.prompt=§6[Decision: Thrinacia] §fYour crew is starving on Apollo's island. What is your command?
odyssey.branch.thrinacia.a=§b[Option 1] §fEnforce Tiresias's warning & spare the cattle (Grants Fire Resistance & Clear Skies)
odyssey.branch.thrinacia.b=§c[Option 2] §fAllow Eurylochus to feast on the sacred herd (Grants Cooked Beef & Strength II)
odyssey.branch.thrinacia.res_a=§6Helios and Apollo honor your restraint with fair winds toward Ithaca!
odyssey.branch.thrinacia.res_b=§cThe crew feasts upon the sacred cattle — dark storm clouds gather overhead!
