odyssey.ship.gear.1=§a[Ship Gear: HALF SPEED — OARS] §7Synchronized rowing (Maneuvering Speed)
odyssey.ship.gear.2=§6[Ship Gear: FULL SAIL + OARS] §7Crimson sail deployed! (Maximum Speed)
odyssey.ship.gear.3=§b[Ship Gear: REVERSE — BACK WATER] §7Backing oars for harbor docking
