odyssey.ship.q.crew_done=§a[Ship Quest 2/7 Complete] §fThe Ithacan oarsmen are mustered at their benches!
odyssey.ship.q.next_prep=§eNext Ship Objective: §7Use the Shipwright's Repair Kit to inspect and prepare the hull.
odyssey.ship.q.prep_done=§a[Ship Quest 3/7 Complete] §fThe tarred oak hull and hemp rigging are seaworthy!
