odyssey.role.odysseus.bio=King of Ithaca, veteran of Troy, held for years on Calypso's island. Cunning before strength.
odyssey.role.odysseus.importance=The heart of the story. Every great trial of the voyage is his to face, and the homecoming is his to win.
odyssey.role.odysseus.abilities=Resistance I. Leads every key rite: the Horse, the stake, the moly, the rite of the dead, the bow.
odyssey.role.odysseus.equipment=Odyssey Astrolabe, driftwood club, bread. Copper arms are earned on the voyage.
odyssey.role.odysseus.duty=Escape Ogygia, lead the crew through each island, and string the bow in his own hall.
odyssey.role.telemachus.bio=Odysseus's son, grown up without a father in a palace overrun by suitors.
odyssey.role.telemachus.importance=The second story: a young man setting out to find the truth about his father.
odyssey.role.telemachus.abilities=Speed I. Scouts ahead, reaches places first, and carries the spear and the prophet's staff later on.
odyssey.role.telemachus.equipment=Odyssey Astrolabe, wooden sword, leather tunic, bread, a small boat.
odyssey.role.telemachus.duty=Seek Mentor, sail to Sparta for news, then scout and guard the crew in his father's tale.
odyssey.role.companion.bio=One of the Ithacan oarsmen who sailed to Troy and never came home.
odyssey.role.companion.importance=The crew are the cost of the voyage. You keep the galley afloat and the men together.
odyssey.role.companion.abilities=Haste I. Repairs the galley, gathers supplies.
odyssey.role.companion.equipment=Odyssey Astrolabe, driftwood club, a ship repair kit, bread.
odyssey.role.companion.duty=Ready the galley on Ogygia, then support Odysseus and Telemachus on every island.
odyssey.role.eumaeus.bio=The old swineherd of Ithaca, who stayed loyal to his absent king for twenty years.
odyssey.role.eumaeus.importance=The first to welcome the king home. He watches the palace while the suitors feast.
odyssey.role.eumaeus.abilities=Night Vision: he knows every path of the island in the dark.
odyssey.role.eumaeus.equipment=Odyssey Astrolabe, wooden sword, roast pork, a small boat.
odyssey.role.eumaeus.duty=Keep watch over the palace, then guide the returning king to his hall.
