odyssey.npc.eumaeus.ch9=§7<Eumaeus> §fA stranger at my gate. Come in, eat — then we'll see about the palace.
odyssey.npc.eumaeus.recognise=§7<Eumaeus> §fThat scar… Master? The gods kept you. Quickly — the hall, before they know you're here.
odyssey.npc.telemachus.ch1=§7<Telemachus> §fI'm going to find out what happened to him. Someone must know.
odyssey.npc.telemachus.ch9=§7<Telemachus> §fFather. Tell me what to do.
