odyssey.story.cyclops_intro=§7Above the beach yawns the cave of a giant shepherd. Keep the Burning Stake ready for nightfall.
odyssey.story.telepylus_intro=§7A still harbour, ringed by cliffs. On the shore a child watches you — a very large child.
